setId":": Assset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Assset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"getPendingRewards(uint256,address)":{"details":"Fetches the pending rewards for a user for a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP","_user":": Address of the user for whom _pending is being computed"},"returns":{"pending":"the amount of rewards pending for _user"}},"getRewardPoolInfo(uint256)":{"details":"Fetches the information of an asset reward pool in PMC","params":{"_assetId":": Asset id of asset reward pool in SMASP"}},"massUpdatePoolRewardVariables(uint256[],uint256)":{"details":"Updates all the reward variables of reward pools in a given phase","params":{"_assetIds":": Array of assetId of all reward pools currently in `_phase`","_phase":": phase for which all reward pools are getting mass-updated Called whenever a new reward pool is added to the PMC {Func: addRewardPool} OR  the allocPoint for an existing reward pool is updated {Func: updateRewardPoolAllocations} This is because the rewards for all pools is affected by the above two actions"}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"paused()":{"details":"Returns true if the contract is paused, and false otherwise."},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"setRewardEmissionRate(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Lets the owner update the `phaseToRewardEmissionRate` for PMC","params":{"_phase":": one of the two global phases of reward pools in PMC","_rewardEmissionRate":": amount of vouchers (`_phase` == 1) or  silent rewards (`_phase` == 2) to be distributed per second in PMC Emits the event {LogUpdateRewardEmissionRate} denoting the newly updated reward emission rate for the `_phase` Requirement: Owner will need to update all the reward pools with the  function: {massupdatePoolRewardVariables} beforehand"}},"stakeSilentToPool(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-stakeSilentToPool}","params":{"_amount":": Amount of Silent tokens to be staked Lets user stake their Silent tokens to a reward pool - _amount cannot be zero - reward pool must be in phase 2 - the current reward period shouldn't have completed - the contract must be in unpaused state - the user must have participated in phase 1 of the reward pool:   UserPoolState.phase should not be zero - the user must have collected voucher rewards in phase 1 Updates the balance of user and the pool based on `_amount` Emits a {LogSilentStakedToPool} event indicating the staked amount","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool"}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"unstakeSilentFromPool(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"See {IPrivacyMining-unstakeSilentFromPool}","params":{"_amount":": Amount of Silent tokens to be unstaked Lets user(caller) unstake their Silent tokens from a reward pool Requirements - reward pool must be in phase 2 - `_amount` cannot be less than user's total stake in the pool - user must be in phase 2 for the given reward pool Updates the balance of user and the pool based on `_amount` powered by user's total voucher balance Transfers `_amount` Silent tokens from contract to the user Emits a {LogSilentUnstakedFromPool} event indicating the updated balance","_assetId":": Assset id of asset reward pool"}},"updatePoolRewardVariables(uint256)":{"details":"Updates the reward variables of a reward pool each time any user interacts with the SC [ deposits/stakes/unstakes/claims] and when the owner updates the reward pool allocations","params":{"_assetId":": assetId of the reward pool being updated"},"returns":{"rewardPool_memory":"the updated instance of RewardPool for the _assetId in memory"}},"updateRewardPoolAllocations(uint256,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Lets the owner update the allocation points for a reward pool","params":{"_assetId":": assetId of the reward pool","_newAllocPoint":": reward allocation point for the reward pool Updates the reward pool variables Emits the event {LogUpdateRewardPool} denoting the _assetId and _newAllocPoint of the rewardPool Requirements: - reward pool's phase must match provided `_phase` NOTE: Owner should batch the function {massupdatePoolRewardVariables} for the same _phase whenever this function is called Maybe a pre-requisite should be that the ","_phase":": expected phase of the reward pool"}}},"stateVariables":{"ACC_REWARD_PRECISION":{"details":"Stores the precision for both reward tokens"},"SILENT":{"details":"Silent token contract Instance expect( (await PrivacyMining.rewardPooInfo(WETH.address)).allocPoint ).to.equal(old_allocPoint);"},"SMASP":{"details":"Address of the SMASP contract"},"deployedPools":{"details":"Stores the assetIds of all reward pools ever deployed"},"phaseToRewardEmissionRate":{"details":"Maps a phase (1 or 2) to its reward emission rate (per second)"},"phaseToTotalAllocPoint":{"details":"Maps a phase (1 or 2) to total allocations of its pools"},"rewardPoolInfo":{"details":"Maps the assetId of an asset to its RewardPool data"},"userPoolInfo":{"details":"Maps a user address and assetId to the struct UserPoolInfo"}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"contracts/PrivacyMining.sol":"PrivacyMining"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs","useLiteralContent":true},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"@openzeppelin/contracts/access/Ownable.sol":{"content":"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
